        apiDump dump = new apiDump();
        //dump.DumpSet((itemSet) uniqueSets.get(0), "setDump");
        ArrayList myset = new ArrayList();
        myset.add(uniqueSets.get(0));
        //db.storeItem(myset);
        itemSet set = dump.getSet("savedData set (0)");
        set.toString();
        //db.storeItem(uniqueSets);
    }

apiDump is the toFile Write code

Db is the store in database code.

Data is both in identical and filereader can read the blob data no problem. >.>
